Add 'pacman' to electron-builder's Linux target list.

Upstream only configures AppImage/deb/rpm. Generate a pacman archive so the
package can reuse electron-builder's desktop entry and complete icon set.

--- a/packages/desktop/electron-builder.config.ts
+++ b/packages/desktop/electron-builder.config.ts
@@ -211,6 +211,6 @@
         },
       },
-      target: ["AppImage", "deb", "rpm"],
+      target: ["AppImage", "deb", "rpm", "pacman"],
     },
   }
 }
